WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.634
-Welcome back.
We're talking to our good pal

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:06.000
David Spade right here,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.567
He has a new comedy special
called "Nothing Personal."

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.367
It's very -- It's hilarious.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:14.400
You talk about everything.
This is your greatest hits.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.267
-Yeah, some of it, yeah.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:20.667
I talked about -- One of
the things was click bait

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.300
because I got caught into
some click bait once

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.767
where someone passed out at
one of my shows, had a seizure.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:28.534
And then you know how they
switch it to get the headline.

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:32.434
It's like, "David Spade stops
show because of seizure."

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:34.167
So, it sounds like it's me,
you know?

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.801
-Yeah.
-So people -- "Oh!"

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.167
And so you click on it.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.000
But the ones that really get you
are so obvious,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.133
and I know they are, and they
just take you down a wormhole,

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.834
but I click them anyway.
-Like what?

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:45.667
-You know, you're just reading
about like,

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.934
"Oh, Cardi B and the draft is
coming up."

00:00:47.934 --> 00:00:50.234
Then it goes, "What's the one
vegetable Tom Brady

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:55.000
refuses to eat?" I'm like...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.667
"This is stupid. Who cares?

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.467
And then I'm like,
"Is it a coconut?"

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:00.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.334
And then it gets in my head
and I can't --

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:04.100
and I start to go down.
And it bothers me.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.601
Everything's blurry.
I go, "I got to find out."

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.334
So I click on it, and it goes,

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.601
"Tom Brady was born
in Northern California."

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:11.701
I go, "Uh-huh."
-Okay.

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:13.834
-"Next."
-Ooh.

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:16.801
-"Tom Brady started playing
football at the age of seven."

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:21.200
I go, "Where's the mother[bleep]

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.100
vegetables that you swore to God
you would talk to me about?"

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.100
And then 55 clicks later, it's
a tomato, ladies and gentlemen.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.501
-It's a tomato. There you go.
Now we know.

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:31.667
-Spoiler alert. I was way off.

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.434
But then they get mean.

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:36.167
It goes, "You'll never guess
what this

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:37.968
'80s actress looks like now."

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:40.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:45.100
I'll save you 48 clicks
and 2 1/2 hours.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.467
She looks like [bleep]
-Okay.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:50.534
-It's so mean. I go, "She aged
30 years in 30 years?

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:52.667
That was her big crime?"
-Yeah, that's what people do.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:55.300
-Then it goes,
"Look at this lady now."

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.734
And it was me.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.734 --> 00:02:01.067
I go, "That's me,
and I look good now."

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:03.033
And they're like,
"What happened to this guy?"

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:04.901
-Let's talk about
"Nothing Personal."

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:07.467
It's on Netflix.
-Yes.

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.601
-What do people need to know
about this special?

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:10.901
-What do they need to
know about it?

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:13.234
I don't know. It's an hour long.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:15.634
And it's mindless stupidity.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.033
And you'll be hungry for comedy
an hour later.

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:21.200
It doesn't even sink in.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.133
It's nothing important,
I'll tell you that.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:25.000
It's not like --
You won't walk away like this.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.701
"Huh, I really have a lot
to think about now."

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:30.100
-You leave going like, "I had
a good time. I laughed."

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:31.834
-Yeah. You're like,
"That was dumb, yeah."

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:33.801
-No. It's super fun.
-It was a good time killer.

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:36.200
-I want to show everyone a clip.
-Oh, we have a clip. Ooh!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.734
-Yeah. Here's David Spade
in "Nothing Personal."

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:39.734
Take a look at this.

00:02:39.734 --> 00:02:41.234
-I sit down and sometimes

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:44.901
it's such a nice restaurant
that the fish is market price.

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:46.133
You ever seen that?

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:47.968
They don't even tell you
how much it is.

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.100
I think the waiter tries to
guess how rich you are.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.133
Because I go,
"How much is the tuna?"

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:55.901
He goes, "Um...

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:59.534
The tuna is...
Bah, bah, bah, la, la, la.

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:02.934
The tuna is...70."

00:03:02.934 --> 00:03:05.467
I go, "70 bucks?
He goes, "40, 40, 40."

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:06.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.934 --> 00:03:10.267
-David Spade, everybody.
Check out his stand-up special

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:12.501
"Nothing Personal" streaming
right now on Netflix.

00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:14.300
-That's the cleanest joke
we could use.

